  "db_name": "PostgreSQL",
  "query": "-- The persistent rebuild barrier of the registry epoch row.\n--\n-- The barrier is read under the epoch row lock, so a caller that locked the\n-- epoch before it reads the barrier sees the state of the same instant as\n-- every other writer.\nSELECT\n    rebuild_state,\n    rebuild_owner_item,\n    rebuild_owner_token,\n    rebuild_fingerprint,\n    rebuild_collection,\n    rebuild_started_at,\n    rebuild_error\nFROM context69.search_registry_epoch\nWHERE id = 1\n",
